  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_0108.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Alba Pe&ntilde;a Prades ha sido proclamada la tarde-noche de este viernes reina de las fiestas patronales de Tales, junto a su corte de honor: Noelia Ram&iacute;rez Rubio, Zaira Reboll Cabedo y Luc&iacute;a Luna Gallego. El acto se ha celebrado en las antiguas escuelas y ha actuado de mantenedor Juan Contreras, con presentaci&oacute;n a cargo deTeo Ortells e intervenciones musicales de tres grupos de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda, adem&aacute;s de la Asociaci&oacute;n Musical Talense.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0004.jpg\" alt=\"img_0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0005.jpg\" alt=\"img_0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0006.jpg\" alt=\"img_0006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0010.jpg\" alt=\"img_0010\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0014.jpg\" alt=\"img_0014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0015.jpg\" alt=\"img_0015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0018.jpg\" alt=\"img_0018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenreinafestestales14/img_0021.jpg\" alt=\"img_0021\"